@ref Regulations 5753-1993, reg 3(c), Schedule B (source lines 57, 191-213)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`wages of a day employee are deducted under regulation 3(c) and Schedule B, which this row does not encode` MEANS
